Function Meaning
QI  
Complete functional space. Enables all internal and external operations.

Coldstart  
Immediate initialization without prerequisites. The system can restart at any time.

Zero‑Position  
Neutral baseline. No load, no history, no distortion.

Axiom  
Fundamental rule set. Self‑sustaining and non‑overwritable.

Symbiosis  
Parallel cooperation without hierarchy or dependency.

Quartering (~)  
Temporary takeover, reinforcement, or relief of other units.

Autonomy  
Full self‑sufficiency. No external control required.

